@prefix :    <http://example.org/> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
# Clause 4, object half, alone: :q is the OBJECT of :r2's reified triple and the
# subject of nothing, and the reified triple itself is unasserted — so every
# statement here was selected through the object side of the disjunction.
:r2 rdf:reifies <<( :p :mentions :q )>> .
:r2 :source :ledger .
